WEBVTT

00:00:00.340 --> 00:00:02.550
'I know everything, Radhi.
- What do you know?'

00:00:02.920 --> 00:00:04.420
'I know that
Reena is your daughter.'

00:00:05.380 --> 00:00:07.830
'The nurses are protesting outside.
- What?'

00:00:07.950 --> 00:00:10.540
'We have sorted all the
complaints you have raised.'

00:00:10.620 --> 00:00:13.880
'If this happens again,
I will also protest with you.'

00:00:14.920 --> 00:00:15.960
'Your husband's reports.'

00:00:16.090 --> 00:00:17.460
'He must have attempted suicide.'

00:00:17.580 --> 00:00:19.880
'Or someone must
have mixed these pills'

00:00:19.920 --> 00:00:21.960
'in his food
without his knowledge.'

00:00:22.040 --> 00:00:25.210
'But I am going to shift this case
for a police investigation.'

00:00:25.410 --> 00:00:26.390
'Inform the police.
- Yes, sir.'

00:00:26.460 --> 00:00:28.370
'Reena and I performed
a surgery on Ganga.'

00:00:28.430 --> 00:00:30.420
'Reena is taking care of her.
But you also do it.'

00:00:30.880 --> 00:00:32.550
'It's about Ganga, right?
I will take care.'

00:00:50.580 --> 00:00:53.790
♪ Listen to the heart ♪

00:00:55.670 --> 00:00:58.290
♪ It beats lub-dub ♪

00:01:00.750 --> 00:01:03.710
♪ Even when patients panic ♪

00:01:05.350 --> 00:01:07.750
♪ Our patience wins ♪

00:01:07.920 --> 00:01:10.380
♪ Our duty is fun-filled ♪

00:01:10.440 --> 00:01:13.080
♪ Every day miracles occur ♪

00:01:13.210 --> 00:01:15.880
♪ I am a doctor ♪

00:01:18.350 --> 00:01:21.000
♪ I'm a two-legged booster ♪

00:01:23.350 --> 00:01:25.920
♪ Life is a theatre ♪

00:01:28.100 --> 00:01:32.670
♪ In it, I'm a doctor ♪

00:01:45.290 --> 00:01:47.130
Hey, what a miracle!

00:01:47.580 --> 00:01:49.830
Reena, you got up so early.
Were you on a walk?

00:01:50.450 --> 00:01:52.460
Reena, where did you go?

00:01:52.800 --> 00:01:55.040
Didn't I tell you I'm going to do
Bharatanatyam for Guna's mother?

00:01:55.080 --> 00:01:56.290
I went to practice.

00:01:56.500 --> 00:01:58.420
Oh, did you go to help them?

00:01:59.250 --> 00:02:01.250
Uncle, don't start in the morning.

00:02:01.670 --> 00:02:04.420
Okay, dear. You go upstairs
and get ready. Come soon.

00:02:04.880 --> 00:02:07.080
There is still time
to go to the hospital.

00:02:07.380 --> 00:02:09.380
I will sleep for a while
and get ready later.

00:02:09.450 --> 00:02:12.930
No, dear. It is our wedding day.
We are going to the temple.

00:02:13.160 --> 00:02:14.350
We want you to come with us too.

00:02:15.570 --> 00:02:17.030
You guys go ahead.
Why should I come?

00:02:17.210 --> 00:02:18.700
We are going every year.

00:02:19.000 --> 00:02:22.710
You are the only one
to show love and affection to us.

00:02:22.800 --> 00:02:24.770
So we'd like you to come with us.

00:02:25.860 --> 00:02:27.540
Okay, I will get ready and come.
- Also..

00:02:27.890 --> 00:02:29.960
Don't wear a 'kurti'
like you're going to work.

00:02:30.360 --> 00:02:32.350
We are going to a temple.
Wear a sari and come.

00:02:33.030 --> 00:02:35.210
Won't they let me inside the temple
if I wear a 'kurti'?

00:02:35.380 --> 00:02:38.170
It'll be decent if you wear a sari.
We'd also feel proud.

00:02:38.750 --> 00:02:40.340
What is with the dress code, Uncle?

00:02:40.500 --> 00:02:43.110
It's not a big deal, true.
But the temple vibe is different.

00:02:43.430 --> 00:02:45.160
Oh, vibe.
- Yes, vibe.

00:02:46.500 --> 00:02:47.860
It will take time to wear a sari.

00:02:47.980 --> 00:02:49.740
Is it okay?
- It's okay, it's your choice.

00:02:49.790 --> 00:02:53.170
You can wear whatever you want.
It's enough if you come with us.

00:02:53.200 --> 00:02:54.070
Take your time.

00:02:54.410 --> 00:02:55.700
It's my opinion, that's all.

00:02:56.850 --> 00:02:57.820
I'll be back.

00:03:05.060 --> 00:03:08.500
Sir, I want to take a photo
with you. Please, sir.

00:03:08.620 --> 00:03:10.320
Just one photo.
- Excuse me.

00:03:11.180 --> 00:03:12.700
Please, sir.
Just one photo.

00:03:12.780 --> 00:03:13.780
Wait for ten minutes.

00:03:14.390 --> 00:03:16.660
I will talk to her and come.
- Okay, thank you, sir. - Okay.

00:03:18.100 --> 00:03:19.340
Hey, wait.

00:03:19.980 --> 00:03:20.820
Don't get up.

00:03:21.570 --> 00:03:22.610
It's okay, Surya.

00:03:23.150 --> 00:03:24.030
What is okay?

00:03:26.450 --> 00:03:27.790
Do you know how weak you are?

00:03:28.420 --> 00:03:29.910
Is it necessary to get up
and sit now?

00:03:30.860 --> 00:03:33.010
You have come to see me so late.

00:03:33.200 --> 00:03:34.780
Yet you pretend to be concerned.

00:03:37.710 --> 00:03:40.290
Were you busy with your new wife?

00:03:43.450 --> 00:03:44.450
Nothing like that.

00:03:47.120 --> 00:03:48.590
Guna told me not to come here.

00:03:49.730 --> 00:03:51.790
He told me that you have
come here in this situation.

00:03:53.700 --> 00:03:54.820
Do you know how I felt?

00:03:57.130 --> 00:03:57.990
I know.

00:03:58.880 --> 00:04:03.140
You will be happy to see me
suffering in this situation.

00:04:03.820 --> 00:04:04.910
What are you saying?

00:04:05.430 --> 00:04:06.820
How can you think like this?

00:04:07.660 --> 00:04:09.340
Enough.
Enough of this drama.

00:04:09.990 --> 00:04:11.610
You are fighting with me
in this situation.

00:04:12.320 --> 00:04:13.420
Am I fighting?

00:04:14.110 --> 00:04:15.410
Then who is fighting?

00:04:16.510 --> 00:04:17.610
You are fighting, right?

00:04:17.900 --> 00:04:19.290
Did I start fighting?

00:04:19.650 --> 00:04:20.610
Yes, it's you.

00:04:20.780 --> 00:04:21.700
Was it me?

00:04:22.060 --> 00:04:24.920
This is why
Guna told you not to come here.

00:04:25.580 --> 00:04:28.110
Come on, Jenny.
Jenny, what are you saying?

00:04:29.210 --> 00:04:30.070
Sir.
- Hi.

00:04:30.460 --> 00:04:32.490
Hi, sir.
- How are you? - Good.

00:04:33.010 --> 00:04:35.380
Hasn't Asha come?
- Asha is very busy.

00:04:35.620 --> 00:04:38.220
By the way, I saw your last movie.

00:04:38.480 --> 00:04:39.320
Superb.

00:04:39.610 --> 00:04:41.680
That fight in the climax
was awesome.

00:04:46.150 --> 00:04:47.070
You heard it, right?

00:04:47.470 --> 00:04:48.700
I saw it too.
- Oh.

00:04:49.730 --> 00:04:53.540
I have never seen such a bad movie
in Tamil cinema. - Hey..

00:04:54.020 --> 00:04:55.250
I don't know how it works.

00:04:57.630 --> 00:04:58.860
She is right, sir.

00:05:03.900 --> 00:05:05.700
Are these the documents?
- Yes, ma'am.

00:05:08.090 --> 00:05:12.500
I have some savings
from what I earned.

00:05:12.870 --> 00:05:15.960
I have bought
some properties for Guna.

00:05:18.560 --> 00:05:20.210
These are the documents.

00:05:21.750 --> 00:05:23.400
He won't accept it
if I give it to him now.

00:05:25.620 --> 00:05:27.540
Give it to him after I'm gone.

00:05:30.740 --> 00:05:33.070
You can keep these documents now.

00:05:57.370 --> 00:06:00.110
You have come in a sari as I asked.
You are listening to me. Very good.

00:06:00.200 --> 00:06:01.690
You asked for a vibe, right?

00:06:01.850 --> 00:06:03.530
It's been a long time
since I wore a sari.

00:06:09.680 --> 00:06:11.610
How are you, Radhi?

00:06:12.250 --> 00:06:14.290
I did not expect to see you here.

00:06:14.610 --> 00:06:16.500
It's all God's plan.

00:06:17.750 --> 00:06:19.080
What I am saying is..

00:06:19.710 --> 00:06:23.420
There is one temple in this area.

00:06:24.240 --> 00:06:26.910
Like how there's only one department
store. That is what I meant.

00:06:27.670 --> 00:06:31.080
Shut up. She has already
made me angry in the hospital.

00:06:31.360 --> 00:06:34.650
You two fighting is a sign of love.
It's the language of love.

00:06:37.300 --> 00:06:40.400
Radhi, it's our
wedding anniversary.

00:06:40.730 --> 00:06:41.950
That's why we've
come to the temple.

00:06:42.250 --> 00:06:43.250
Happy Anniversary.

00:06:43.400 --> 00:06:44.320
Thanks.
- Me too.

00:06:46.680 --> 00:06:48.530
I meant to say
that it's my anniversary too.

00:06:52.820 --> 00:06:54.280
Welcome.
Whose name do I have to pray for?

00:06:54.470 --> 00:06:55.840
Do it in the name of God.
- Give me.

00:06:56.010 --> 00:06:56.900
Seek his blessings.

00:06:58.740 --> 00:07:00.000
Tell me your star sign.

00:07:00.570 --> 00:07:02.150
Ganesh, Star 'Pooram'.

00:07:02.260 --> 00:07:03.630
Sarada, Star 'Uthradam'.

00:07:04.170 --> 00:07:05.630
What is your star sign?

00:07:10.750 --> 00:07:12.040
At least tell us your birth date.

00:07:12.630 --> 00:07:13.880
Don't overdo it.

00:07:14.320 --> 00:07:17.380
Say it quickly.
- I can't. She doesn't know.

00:07:17.710 --> 00:07:18.560
Okay.

00:07:34.980 --> 00:07:36.950
Hello!
- Lord Muruga..

00:07:37.240 --> 00:07:38.150
Hello!

00:07:40.770 --> 00:07:42.570
Lord Muruga..

00:07:43.480 --> 00:07:44.920
Save me from her.

00:07:48.950 --> 00:07:50.030
I'm calling you.

00:07:51.150 --> 00:07:52.650
Is my name 'Hello'?

00:07:53.530 --> 00:07:56.170
Why are you torturing my mother?

00:07:56.980 --> 00:07:58.460
I am not torturing my mother.

00:07:59.100 --> 00:08:01.170
Your mother?
- Yes, my mother.

00:08:01.320 --> 00:08:02.320
She is my mother.

00:08:02.580 --> 00:08:04.790
She was my mother first.
She became your mother after that.

00:08:05.450 --> 00:08:07.070
Look here.
- Tell me.

00:08:07.950 --> 00:08:10.130
Why are you following
my mother everywhere?

00:08:10.240 --> 00:08:11.950
The supermarket, temple, hospital..

00:08:12.020 --> 00:08:14.460
You are doing something
wherever she goes.

00:08:14.650 --> 00:08:16.780
It's been a long time since
my mother smiled, do you know?

00:08:17.050 --> 00:08:19.580
Divi, I have never seen her smile.

00:08:19.950 --> 00:08:22.280
She has been scolding me
ever since I came here.

00:08:22.920 --> 00:08:25.120
I didn't think that mom
would be in the supermarket.

00:08:25.270 --> 00:08:27.180
I didn't think that mom
would be in the temple.

00:08:27.410 --> 00:08:29.320
I thought that mom
would be in the hospital.

00:08:29.770 --> 00:08:32.090
I have nothing to do with anything
else that is happening here.

00:08:33.070 --> 00:08:35.020
If you talk to me like this again

00:08:35.460 --> 00:08:36.740
I won't be like this every time.

00:08:36.880 --> 00:08:38.670
I will get angry and bite you.

00:08:40.010 --> 00:08:42.610
You'll pay for this.
I'll make you pay for it.

00:08:42.930 --> 00:08:44.610
You live in front
of my house, don't you?

00:08:45.470 --> 00:08:46.280
Be my guest.

00:08:46.560 --> 00:08:48.780
You talk to me if you need anything
and ignore me otherwise.

00:08:49.200 --> 00:08:50.880
You'll pay for it.
Go away.

00:08:51.260 --> 00:08:52.580
You will come to me one day.

00:08:52.690 --> 00:08:55.080
You go away. I won't
come to you. Go away.

00:08:56.080 --> 00:08:57.620
You little..

00:08:58.340 --> 00:08:59.200
Ouch!

00:08:59.360 --> 00:09:01.280
Lord Muruga..

00:09:01.420 --> 00:09:03.530
Lord Muruga..

00:09:05.770 --> 00:09:07.400
Hey, let's go this way.

00:09:12.900 --> 00:09:14.170
How did your date with Reena go?

00:09:14.720 --> 00:09:15.650
It went well.

00:09:16.820 --> 00:09:20.020
I heard that you told her
about your lifestyle.

00:09:20.430 --> 00:09:21.710
I heard that you went to the beach.

00:09:22.400 --> 00:09:24.050
I was just kidding.

00:09:24.670 --> 00:09:27.400
Reena told him the truth.

00:09:28.240 --> 00:09:29.320
I heard that too.

00:09:29.920 --> 00:09:34.400
Still, you want to take Reena
to the beach and hug her.

00:09:34.740 --> 00:09:37.460
Is this the only thing or do
you have any other dreams?

00:09:38.340 --> 00:09:39.780
There are many
such things, Nilofer.

00:09:40.140 --> 00:09:43.030
It's not like all our wishes
will come true.

00:09:43.820 --> 00:09:44.700
That's true.

00:09:45.750 --> 00:09:48.210
What are we doing here?

00:09:48.530 --> 00:09:49.630
Why did you bring me here?

00:09:50.360 --> 00:09:51.320
I will tell you.

00:09:55.410 --> 00:09:56.920
Hey, Nilofer.

00:09:57.540 --> 00:09:58.820
What is your father doing here?

00:10:00.210 --> 00:10:01.880
You wanted to tell
Reena about you, right?

00:10:02.070 --> 00:10:04.900
My father is here to know
exclusively about you.

00:10:04.960 --> 00:10:06.950
About me?
Why should he know about me?

00:10:07.100 --> 00:10:09.460
How can he give
his daughter away to a stranger?

00:10:09.710 --> 00:10:10.570
You mean, bride?

00:10:11.000 --> 00:10:15.820
You take him to a tea shop
and tell him about your lifestyle.

00:10:16.790 --> 00:10:18.320
Bye. Bye!
- Nilofer..

00:10:18.740 --> 00:10:20.300
I know that you'll handle it.
- Hey!

00:10:22.760 --> 00:10:23.610
Hi.

00:10:25.910 --> 00:10:26.820
Hi.

00:10:26.990 --> 00:10:27.860
Come here.

00:10:32.430 --> 00:10:33.320
How are you?

00:10:33.650 --> 00:10:34.490
I am fine.

00:10:41.320 --> 00:10:42.180
Hello.

00:10:42.470 --> 00:10:43.310
Hello, Arjun.

00:10:43.740 --> 00:10:44.570
Yes, who is this?

00:10:46.360 --> 00:10:47.200
It's Manasa.

00:10:48.090 --> 00:10:48.970
Oh.

00:10:49.340 --> 00:10:50.150
Hi, Manasa.

00:10:51.120 --> 00:10:53.960
Why are you calling me after
a long time after the interview?

00:10:54.540 --> 00:10:55.400
How did the interview go?

00:10:56.360 --> 00:10:57.240
It went well.

00:10:57.690 --> 00:10:58.570
But..

00:10:59.330 --> 00:11:00.190
Tell me.

00:11:02.490 --> 00:11:04.040
It didn't go as expected.

00:11:04.680 --> 00:11:06.820
That's why I was
hesitant to call you.

00:11:11.510 --> 00:11:12.400
Sorry, Manasa.

00:11:13.290 --> 00:11:15.130
You didn't get that job
because of me, right?

00:11:17.050 --> 00:11:21.110
If you hadn't come on time,
I wouldn't have reached on time.

00:11:25.500 --> 00:11:27.600
Arjun, are you there?

00:11:27.740 --> 00:11:29.540
Yes.
- Why are you silent?

00:11:31.920 --> 00:11:33.500
Will you do it
if I tell you something?

00:11:34.670 --> 00:11:35.570
Tell me.

00:11:36.240 --> 00:11:37.320
I will send you an address.

00:11:37.700 --> 00:11:39.780
Can you bring your certificates
and go there tomorrow?

00:11:40.780 --> 00:11:42.450
Why do you have
to trouble yourself?

00:11:42.850 --> 00:11:44.200
I don't want to bother you.

00:11:44.920 --> 00:11:46.150
It's not a trouble at all.

00:11:46.550 --> 00:11:47.530
You come.

00:11:51.030 --> 00:11:51.990
What are you thinking?

00:11:53.890 --> 00:11:54.900
Okay, I'll come.

00:11:55.650 --> 00:11:56.570
Okay, bye.

00:11:57.250 --> 00:11:58.110
See you.

00:12:08.450 --> 00:12:09.360
Radhi.

00:12:12.360 --> 00:12:13.240
Come, dear.

00:12:14.000 --> 00:12:14.890
Come and sit.

00:12:25.480 --> 00:12:26.320
Take some saffron.

00:12:29.600 --> 00:12:30.430
Radhi.

00:12:31.520 --> 00:12:33.210
I wanted to talk to you.

00:12:33.960 --> 00:12:36.040
I know you have a lot
of problems at home.

00:12:37.540 --> 00:12:39.250
I know you have a lot of problems.

00:12:41.110 --> 00:12:43.500
Still, it's not good for you
to avoid Reena.

00:12:43.790 --> 00:12:45.280
Sir, I didn't avoid her.

00:12:46.410 --> 00:12:48.840
She is still working
in that hospital.

00:12:49.180 --> 00:12:50.540
I left her.

00:12:51.240 --> 00:12:55.960
What if she feels that she is
the reason why you left?

00:12:56.820 --> 00:13:00.290
Sir, you don't understand.
It's not like I can coddle her.

00:13:02.000 --> 00:13:03.630
I'm not asking you to coddle her.

00:13:04.050 --> 00:13:05.500
You have to know about her, right?

00:13:06.490 --> 00:13:10.040
Why did you abandon her? Why
did you leave her at an orphanage?

00:13:10.170 --> 00:13:12.020
How did she grow up?
Who is her father?

00:13:12.120 --> 00:13:14.100
Doesn't she have the right
to know all these things?

00:13:14.610 --> 00:13:16.000
You don't want Reena.

00:13:16.580 --> 00:13:18.250
You won't talk to her.
You won't bond with her.

00:13:18.540 --> 00:13:19.710
You won't even see her.

00:13:20.450 --> 00:13:21.880
That's not a problem at all.

00:13:23.090 --> 00:13:24.250
But we want Reena.

00:13:24.770 --> 00:13:27.130
We want Reena as long
as Sarada and I are alive.

00:13:27.650 --> 00:13:29.520
We will take care of her
as much as we can.

00:13:30.270 --> 00:13:31.320
She will take care of us.

00:13:32.140 --> 00:13:33.860
Who Reena is, it's her identity.

00:13:35.360 --> 00:13:38.420
It's wrong not to tell her.

00:13:39.620 --> 00:13:43.340
At least today, put your
scepticism aside and tell her.

00:13:44.390 --> 00:13:46.590
I'm not asking you
to talk to her immediately.

00:13:48.130 --> 00:13:48.990
Take your time.

00:13:50.370 --> 00:13:52.520
But tell her as soon as you can.

00:13:52.670 --> 00:13:53.670
She deserves to know.

00:13:56.560 --> 00:13:57.830
Amaya.

00:13:58.280 --> 00:14:01.000
Did you get the report?
- Yes.

00:14:01.360 --> 00:14:02.240
Give it to me.

00:14:11.950 --> 00:14:12.830
Amaya.

00:14:13.880 --> 00:14:16.130
Chronic granulomatous pharyngitis.

00:14:16.950 --> 00:14:18.880
It's just an ulcer in the throat.

00:14:19.020 --> 00:14:20.340
You didn't treat it.

00:14:20.620 --> 00:14:23.450
The tissues are damaged
and there is blood. That's it.

00:14:23.530 --> 00:14:25.650
That's all?
- That's all?

00:14:25.870 --> 00:14:27.420
Do you want more?

00:14:27.730 --> 00:14:30.880
I thought I would bleed to death
like they show in movies.

00:14:32.210 --> 00:14:34.790
It's a good day.
Why do you want to die?

00:14:35.850 --> 00:14:37.610
Death is a good thing.

00:14:38.900 --> 00:14:40.790
That good thing
won't happen to you now.

00:14:41.010 --> 00:14:42.780
It's just an infection.

00:14:43.190 --> 00:14:44.500
But it's severe.

00:14:46.310 --> 00:14:47.490
Why don't you get admitted?

00:14:49.060 --> 00:14:50.320
Is there any other option?

00:14:52.140 --> 00:14:55.600
Okay. I'll give you a prescription.
You go home and take a rest.

00:14:56.740 --> 00:15:00.650
Kamal, I told you how important
this salary is for my family.

00:15:01.680 --> 00:15:04.360
I can't treat you if you
keep giving excuses like this.

00:15:06.610 --> 00:15:07.530
Let's do this.

00:15:08.690 --> 00:15:10.610
I will write the prescription
for this infection.

00:15:11.100 --> 00:15:12.700
Give it to someone.

00:15:13.230 --> 00:15:14.460
They will give the medicine.

00:15:14.620 --> 00:15:16.170
You don't have to pay for it now.

00:15:17.690 --> 00:15:19.200
I don't want any loan.

00:15:19.540 --> 00:15:21.030
Listen to me.

00:15:21.610 --> 00:15:22.900
You don't have to pay for it now.

00:15:23.280 --> 00:15:24.530
Give it to me after a month.

00:15:24.820 --> 00:15:25.650
Okay?

00:15:27.000 --> 00:15:28.450
You have to take
care of your health.

00:15:29.160 --> 00:15:30.330
Okay?
Take it for that.

00:15:30.870 --> 00:15:32.280
No.
- Take it.

00:15:47.320 --> 00:15:48.220
Did you call me?

00:15:51.210 --> 00:15:54.200
If you called me here to scold me,
I will tell you now.

00:15:54.330 --> 00:15:56.240
I have nothing to do with what
Uncle Ganesh said earlier.

00:15:57.450 --> 00:15:58.570
I didn't come to talk about that.

00:15:59.270 --> 00:16:00.160
Oh.

00:16:00.920 --> 00:16:01.820
Is it Divi..

00:16:02.310 --> 00:16:04.630
I don't know what
she complained about me to you.

00:16:04.720 --> 00:16:07.500
She hit me with the coconut first.
Then I hit her.

00:16:09.900 --> 00:16:11.170
Why are you glaring at me now?

00:16:11.650 --> 00:16:13.710
I said she hit me too.
Did you glare at me for that?

00:16:14.500 --> 00:16:16.040
I didn't come
to talk about that either.

00:16:16.620 --> 00:16:18.210
Is there anything else?
Can I talk now?

00:16:18.990 --> 00:16:19.820
Tell me.

00:16:22.920 --> 00:16:23.820
Reena.

00:16:27.430 --> 00:16:31.390
Everyone around us
wants to know about our past.

00:16:31.950 --> 00:16:33.650
They want me
to tell you everything.

00:16:34.040 --> 00:16:36.030
That's right.
You should know about it.

00:16:37.700 --> 00:16:41.170
But I really can't do it, Reena.

00:16:42.950 --> 00:16:45.040
I don't have the courage to say it.

00:16:46.150 --> 00:16:49.630
I didn't have the courage
when I left you in that orphanage.

00:16:50.760 --> 00:16:53.790
I don't have the courage even after
I found out that you're my daughter.

00:16:54.960 --> 00:16:57.140
I might look
brave and bold outside.

00:16:58.050 --> 00:17:02.400
But I don't have the courage
to face you every time.

00:17:03.410 --> 00:17:05.540
Every time you come in front of me

00:17:06.210 --> 00:17:10.690
I can't make you understand

00:17:10.730 --> 00:17:13.740
how much pain and heaviness I felt.

00:17:17.430 --> 00:17:18.650
I will try to understand.

00:17:20.670 --> 00:17:22.000
But tell me one thing.

00:17:23.350 --> 00:17:25.130
If you can't tell me this,

00:17:26.400 --> 00:17:27.900
who else can I ask?

00:17:29.060 --> 00:17:30.420
I wanted to ask your father.

00:17:30.950 --> 00:17:32.540
But he left for his hometown.

00:17:34.450 --> 00:17:36.900
But what does he know
about why you abandoned me?

00:17:39.940 --> 00:17:42.780
There's no way the one who
accompanied you would know it.

00:17:45.450 --> 00:17:46.320
That's right.

00:17:48.540 --> 00:17:51.590
There's no way the one who
accompanied me would know it.

00:17:52.820 --> 00:17:55.590
But he was not the one
who accompanied me.

00:17:56.410 --> 00:17:57.360
I was the one who accompanied him.

00:17:59.380 --> 00:18:04.670
My father is the one
who made me leave you there.

00:19:27.804 --> 00:19:31.144
♪ Listen to the heart ♪

00:19:32.804 --> 00:19:35.514
♪ It beats lub-dub ♪

00:19:37.934 --> 00:19:40.974
♪ Even when patients panic ♪

00:19:42.634 --> 00:19:45.054
♪ Our patience wins ♪

00:19:45.134 --> 00:19:47.604
♪ Our duty is fun-filled ♪

00:19:47.684 --> 00:19:50.314
♪ Every day miracles occur ♪

00:19:50.564 --> 00:19:53.054
♪ I am a doctor ♪

00:19:55.474 --> 00:19:58.214
♪ I'm a two-legged booster ♪

00:20:00.434 --> 00:20:03.144
♪ Life is a theatre ♪

00:20:05.134 --> 00:20:09.784
♪ In it, I'm a doctor ♪

00:20:24.514 --> 00:20:25.554
Good morning.

00:20:27.574 --> 00:20:28.604
Uncle.
- What is it?

00:20:29.234 --> 00:20:30.764
Do you have Thyagarajan's number?

00:20:32.514 --> 00:20:33.684
Yes, but..

00:20:34.164 --> 00:20:35.084
Why are you hesitating?

00:20:35.454 --> 00:20:38.144
I don't know his current number.

00:20:38.234 --> 00:20:40.764
He is not replying to my good
morning messages. That's why.

00:20:40.854 --> 00:20:42.404
I am also not replying
to your messages.

00:20:42.524 --> 00:20:44.144
Does that mean
you don't have my number?

00:20:44.644 --> 00:20:46.104
He is not answering my calls.

00:20:46.324 --> 00:20:47.394
That's a different issue.

00:20:47.684 --> 00:20:50.634
I forgot to ask for his number.
I am getting old.

00:20:50.824 --> 00:20:51.694
Okay, bye.

00:21:01.214 --> 00:21:02.704
Sid, hi.

00:21:03.044 --> 00:21:03.874
Dude, hi.

00:21:10.634 --> 00:21:11.514
Get lost.

00:21:11.564 --> 00:21:12.724
Why did she come here now?

00:21:19.294 --> 00:21:20.234
Ramakrishnan.

00:21:20.814 --> 00:21:22.484
I want to tell you
something important.

00:21:22.764 --> 00:21:23.694
Personal?
- Yes.

00:21:24.174 --> 00:21:25.104
Then wait a minute.

00:21:26.914 --> 00:21:27.774
What are you doing?

00:21:27.844 --> 00:21:29.764
Wait a minute.
- What is he searching for?

00:21:36.894 --> 00:21:37.774
Nothing.

00:21:38.094 --> 00:21:40.724
I was wondering if Nilofer
is hiding somewhere.

00:21:41.824 --> 00:21:44.254
I don't know how,
but she knows everything.

00:21:44.794 --> 00:21:46.684
Is anyone here?
- No.

00:21:46.864 --> 00:21:49.064
But still, keep your voice low.

00:21:50.124 --> 00:21:51.074
What is the matter?

00:21:51.824 --> 00:21:53.074
Do you know something?

00:21:53.264 --> 00:21:55.104
Not only did he drop me
at the orphanage

00:21:55.184 --> 00:21:57.184
Thyagarajan is the main
reason for everything.

00:21:58.444 --> 00:21:59.334
Oh.

00:22:00.314 --> 00:22:01.484
I knew it.

00:22:01.984 --> 00:22:04.434
I got a vibe when I saw him.

00:22:05.504 --> 00:22:07.894
Only cunning people like him
can act so innocent.

00:22:08.264 --> 00:22:09.704
Who said that?
- I did.

00:22:09.984 --> 00:22:11.854
Don't talk ill of my grandpa.

00:22:12.834 --> 00:22:13.774
Okay, sorry.

00:22:14.864 --> 00:22:16.524
Not only did he drop me
at the orphanage

00:22:16.824 --> 00:22:20.024
he pretended to be so loving
and caring towards me here.

00:22:20.494 --> 00:22:22.644
Do you know something?
- I don't know.

00:22:22.764 --> 00:22:27.104
He said that I was like his
granddaughter, indirectly.

00:22:27.224 --> 00:22:29.024
What an actor!

00:22:30.994 --> 00:22:34.644
Reena, you told me not to talk ill
of him, but you're doing it now.

00:22:35.644 --> 00:22:36.604
What should I do?

00:22:38.254 --> 00:22:41.224
You have only one way
to understand all this.

00:22:41.524 --> 00:22:42.814
You have to talk to your grandpa.

00:22:43.814 --> 00:22:46.104
Are you mad?
I don't have his number.

00:22:47.194 --> 00:22:48.604
What should we do?

00:22:49.204 --> 00:22:50.624
Did you ask Divi?

00:22:51.604 --> 00:22:53.184
She is trying to kill me
with coconuts.

00:22:53.634 --> 00:22:55.804
Oh.. Is it that bad?

00:22:56.974 --> 00:22:58.064
You can ask Mr. Dev.

00:22:58.684 --> 00:23:00.104
But you ruined his life.

00:23:03.444 --> 00:23:05.894
If we ask him, he will beat us.

00:23:07.574 --> 00:23:08.564
There is only one way.

00:23:08.754 --> 00:23:09.624
What is it?

00:23:10.014 --> 00:23:12.474
Shall we steal Dr. Radhi's phone?

00:23:12.704 --> 00:23:13.684
What do you say?

00:23:14.774 --> 00:23:16.704
Why are you getting shocked?

00:23:17.514 --> 00:23:18.984
Are we going to steal?

00:23:19.644 --> 00:23:22.294
We will take a number
from it and keep it back.

00:23:22.774 --> 00:23:23.934
That's it.
- Are you mad?

00:23:24.114 --> 00:23:26.054
Do you think it's easy
to take her phone?

00:23:26.344 --> 00:23:28.064
We both can't do it.

00:23:28.394 --> 00:23:30.644
But there is one person.
- Who is it?

00:23:32.184 --> 00:23:33.814
Why should I do it?

00:23:34.344 --> 00:23:35.354
Teju, please.

00:23:36.244 --> 00:23:37.474
Yes, please.

00:23:40.744 --> 00:23:41.604
Please, Teju.

00:23:43.164 --> 00:23:45.644
Who told you that I do such things?

00:23:48.174 --> 00:23:49.094
Yes.

00:23:59.754 --> 00:24:01.814
I'm letting you go because
you hit me playfully.

00:24:06.334 --> 00:24:09.434
Please help me.
I need Thyagarajan's number.

00:24:09.524 --> 00:24:10.974
You have to get her phone for me.

00:24:11.164 --> 00:24:14.684
He gave you the plan, right?
Take him, he will help you.

00:24:15.284 --> 00:24:18.814
Teju, even if you don't like me,
I know that you care about me.

00:24:19.264 --> 00:24:20.394
I don't care about you.

00:24:20.884 --> 00:24:22.974
We will return the phone
before she knows it.

00:24:23.064 --> 00:24:26.954
Do you think she would've
kept her phone unlocked for you?

00:24:28.354 --> 00:24:29.854
What will you do for the password?

00:24:31.544 --> 00:24:34.104
If we get caught, that's it.
It's an unnecessary risk.

00:24:34.294 --> 00:24:35.974
Hey, are you talking about risk?

00:24:36.324 --> 00:24:37.634
You would've sold this hospital.

00:24:40.574 --> 00:24:42.434
Teju, you are always with her.

00:24:42.524 --> 00:24:43.684
Try to get the password.

00:24:43.794 --> 00:24:45.814
It's okay if you don't get it.
Just take the phone.

00:24:45.874 --> 00:24:47.144
We will see the rest later.

00:24:53.964 --> 00:24:54.854
Talk to her.

00:24:55.214 --> 00:24:56.104
Okay.

00:24:57.064 --> 00:24:59.564
I am doing it because you
asked me to get the number.

00:25:01.184 --> 00:25:02.864
But no one should know that.
- Okay.

00:25:02.974 --> 00:25:04.524
Whose phone are you going to take?

00:25:09.144 --> 00:25:12.464
I told you to be
careful while talking.

00:25:12.894 --> 00:25:14.064
Hey, what is this, Rocky?

00:25:16.764 --> 00:25:19.144
Hey, shall we tell her?

00:25:19.894 --> 00:25:21.724
If not, she will ask questions.

00:25:23.724 --> 00:25:24.604
Tell her.

00:25:31.024 --> 00:25:32.724
So, are you all going
to steal a phone?

00:25:33.154 --> 00:25:34.354
Shall I also join?

00:25:35.844 --> 00:25:36.804
Great.

00:25:37.244 --> 00:25:38.184
No, don't.

00:25:38.634 --> 00:25:42.594
You can join us,
but don't get us caught.

00:25:42.684 --> 00:25:46.084
No, no. If I commit to something,
I will be 100% honest.

00:25:46.394 --> 00:25:48.434
So, you can trust me.
But I have a doubt.

00:25:48.674 --> 00:25:51.394
Why should we take your grandpa's
number from Dr. Radhi's phone?

00:25:51.494 --> 00:25:53.144
Why?
Do you have his number?

00:25:53.494 --> 00:25:54.314
No.

00:25:54.664 --> 00:25:56.684
He came to the hospital
twice for his check-up.

00:25:57.004 --> 00:26:00.364
So we can get his number
from the reception desk.

00:26:06.364 --> 00:26:07.224
What?

00:26:12.394 --> 00:26:13.284
Dial it..

00:26:17.774 --> 00:26:18.754
Talk.

00:26:22.274 --> 00:26:23.934
Hello.
- Hello.

00:26:26.584 --> 00:26:28.274
Hello.
- Hey, ask them.

00:26:29.684 --> 00:26:32.364
I am calling from
Oda mobile customer care.

00:26:32.434 --> 00:26:33.644
This is not an Oda mobile number.

00:26:34.144 --> 00:26:35.064
Sorry, sorry.

00:26:35.364 --> 00:26:37.474
I am calling from
AirTalk customer care.

00:26:37.894 --> 00:26:39.474
This is not an AirTalk
number either.

00:26:41.144 --> 00:26:42.434
Is this Thyagarajan?

00:26:43.854 --> 00:26:46.134
You are asking if it's Thyagarajan
after hearing a lady's voice.

00:26:47.144 --> 00:26:48.354
What are they saying?
Is it him?

00:26:48.454 --> 00:26:50.434
No, I was about to ask
if this is Thyagarajan's number.

00:26:51.654 --> 00:26:52.644
Who are you?

00:26:53.064 --> 00:26:54.224
How are you related to him?
- Talk..

00:26:54.914 --> 00:26:56.264
Why are you calling him?

00:26:56.554 --> 00:26:59.564
Ma'am, I called his number. Why
are you asking so many questions?

00:26:59.634 --> 00:27:01.134
He's blabbering.
- Hello, mister.

00:27:01.354 --> 00:27:03.844
Who are you?
Won't you reveal your identity?

00:27:04.134 --> 00:27:05.474
You are talking unnecessarily.

00:27:05.844 --> 00:27:06.934
Hello.. Mrs..

00:27:07.254 --> 00:27:10.304
If you talk rudely,
I will get angry.

00:27:10.354 --> 00:27:11.514
I won't get scared for this.

00:27:11.704 --> 00:27:13.064
I will kill you, talk.

00:27:13.314 --> 00:27:14.934
Tell me who you are.

00:27:15.494 --> 00:27:16.394
Shut up.

00:27:17.164 --> 00:27:19.894
Tell me who you are if you dare.

00:27:20.684 --> 00:27:22.014
I am Thyagarajan's daughter.

00:27:22.144 --> 00:27:24.624
How many daughters does your
grandfather have? - Speak properly.

00:27:26.024 --> 00:27:28.804
What's your filial rank
to Thyagarajan?

00:27:30.974 --> 00:27:32.644
His one and only daughter,
Dr. Radhi.

00:27:34.014 --> 00:27:37.064
What are you doing?
Sit down and talk. - For respect.

00:27:37.234 --> 00:27:38.224
For respect?

00:27:38.394 --> 00:27:40.984
Do you want any other details?
Can you tell me who you are now?

00:27:41.084 --> 00:27:42.684
No, madam.
- What happened?

00:27:42.774 --> 00:27:43.894
These details are enough.
- What happened?

00:27:44.464 --> 00:27:47.354
I am not a doctor.
But I can't tell you my name.

00:27:48.644 --> 00:27:49.604
Thank you.

00:27:55.444 --> 00:27:56.454
Hey.

00:27:57.104 --> 00:27:59.604
I asked you to get his number.
Why are you talking like this?

00:28:01.484 --> 00:28:04.264
He has given her mother's number.

00:28:08.764 --> 00:28:11.144
Were you talking to Radhi?

00:28:19.884 --> 00:28:21.764
So, Operation Radhi Phone begins.

00:28:25.874 --> 00:28:27.644
Manasa, introduce yourself.

00:28:28.944 --> 00:28:30.024
My name is Manasa.

00:28:30.144 --> 00:28:32.684
I completed my B.Sc. Psychology
at Christ University.

00:28:32.824 --> 00:28:35.984
I did my M.Sc. in National Health
of Mental Health and Neuroscience.

00:28:36.084 --> 00:28:40.314
I joined the Central Institute of
Psychiatry, which is one of the best

00:28:40.394 --> 00:28:42.854
as an intern and worked
as a psychologist for two years.

00:28:43.114 --> 00:28:45.314
Oh, nice, carry on.

00:28:46.334 --> 00:28:50.684
Then I was an EAP counsellor
in a hospital in Bangalore.

00:28:51.004 --> 00:28:51.894
Manasa.

00:28:52.644 --> 00:28:54.224
You were a clinical psychologist.

00:28:55.044 --> 00:28:57.734
But now you have jumped
to the corporate side.

00:28:59.314 --> 00:29:00.764
I forgot, sorry.

00:29:01.594 --> 00:29:04.424
In between, I did a study
on employee well-being.

00:29:04.564 --> 00:29:06.054
So, I have also got a Ph.D.

00:29:06.774 --> 00:29:07.854
Can I see your certificates?

00:29:08.144 --> 00:29:09.024
Yeah, sure.

00:29:12.334 --> 00:29:13.734
Manasa, I want you to know

00:29:13.874 --> 00:29:16.554
that you are not going to work
as a clinical psychologist here.

00:29:17.174 --> 00:29:18.614
We need your expertise.

00:29:18.794 --> 00:29:21.224
In fact, we prioritise
our employees.

00:29:22.054 --> 00:29:24.624
We are considering you because
our employees' mental health

00:29:24.674 --> 00:29:25.764
is very important to us.

00:29:26.284 --> 00:29:27.184
I know.

00:29:27.434 --> 00:29:29.854
So, I think I am
the right person for this.

00:29:31.404 --> 00:29:32.734
Yes, I feel it too.

00:29:33.624 --> 00:29:36.934
Do you have a structure
or strategy for this?

00:29:37.244 --> 00:29:38.394
How are you going to start?

00:29:38.914 --> 00:29:41.184
Sir, with all due respect

00:29:41.804 --> 00:29:43.984
we can't have
strategies in psychology.

00:29:44.294 --> 00:29:46.934
In fact, we need to treat
each patient in a different way.

00:29:48.404 --> 00:29:49.434
Give me some time.

00:29:50.034 --> 00:29:53.604
I will build a profile
for all your employees.

00:29:54.154 --> 00:29:56.104
So, we can start
the therapy accordingly.

00:30:01.314 --> 00:30:02.564
Hey, she is coming.

00:30:03.884 --> 00:30:06.604
She is in the conference room.
Her phone is with her.

00:30:09.214 --> 00:30:10.684
Amaya, where are you going?

00:30:11.644 --> 00:30:14.214
I need to get some files
signed by Dr. Radhi.

00:30:14.574 --> 00:30:15.904
Give me the files.
I will get it.

00:30:16.164 --> 00:30:17.134
No, I will get it.

00:30:17.194 --> 00:30:19.484
No, no. It's Dr. Radhi.
I will get it. You go.

00:30:20.464 --> 00:30:21.364
Okay.

00:30:23.364 --> 00:30:24.484
Super.
Go inside.

00:30:24.824 --> 00:30:27.394
All the best.
- Come. - I'm not coming.

00:30:27.714 --> 00:30:30.124
No matter which of your employees
comes for counselling

00:30:30.354 --> 00:30:33.324
I will make sure that
the environment is only for them.

00:30:33.614 --> 00:30:35.564
No distraction,
no pressure, nothing.

00:30:36.104 --> 00:30:38.834
Sir, when your patients
come to me for counselling

00:30:39.064 --> 00:30:42.184
they can talk about anything.
I will guarantee their privacy.

00:30:42.284 --> 00:30:43.984
And it is 100% confidential.

00:30:44.174 --> 00:30:45.184
You can trust me.

00:30:47.154 --> 00:30:48.034
Ma'am.

00:30:48.934 --> 00:30:50.444
These files need to be signed.

00:30:53.244 --> 00:30:54.104
Wait for five minutes.

00:30:55.084 --> 00:30:57.854
RK Hospital is a hospital that
has been here for many years.

00:30:59.034 --> 00:31:00.984
We treat all the patients equally.

00:31:01.524 --> 00:31:04.104
Similarly, the doctors
and staff here.

00:31:04.444 --> 00:31:07.484
So, we hope that you will
treat everyone equally.

00:31:08.174 --> 00:31:09.234
Definitely, Arjun.

00:31:09.774 --> 00:31:12.234
No matter what position
they hold in this hospital

00:31:12.394 --> 00:31:13.604
they are my patients.

00:31:13.824 --> 00:31:14.894
So, I will take care of them.

00:31:15.774 --> 00:31:18.644
By the way, you
didn't study in Chennai.

00:31:19.224 --> 00:31:20.314
You didn't work in Chennai.

00:31:20.934 --> 00:31:23.184
How did you come
to Chennai all of a sudden?

00:31:24.134 --> 00:31:25.854
Chennai is my native place, sir.

00:31:26.934 --> 00:31:31.224
In fact, all my relatives and
all my belongings are here.

00:31:31.704 --> 00:31:36.434
So, I came here to collect
all my belongings.

00:31:42.184 --> 00:31:44.604
Reena.
- What? - I took the phone.

00:31:44.994 --> 00:31:45.854
Hey, super.

00:31:46.064 --> 00:31:47.204
Password.
Check the password.

00:31:48.934 --> 00:31:50.014
What is your birth date?

00:31:52.074 --> 00:31:54.304
She doesn't know my birth date.

00:31:54.434 --> 00:31:56.734
I don't know her birth date.
- Hey, Reena..

00:31:57.004 --> 00:31:59.144
Control your sentiments.
What should I do for the password?

00:31:59.804 --> 00:32:00.984
I don't know.
Do something.

00:32:01.694 --> 00:32:03.714
There are some rules and
regulations for this hospital.

00:32:03.974 --> 00:32:06.204
So, it will be easier for you
if you take care of that.

00:32:06.954 --> 00:32:07.774
Sure, ma'am.

00:32:07.804 --> 00:32:09.564
I think I have a soft copy of that.

00:32:09.584 --> 00:32:10.934
I will send it to you.

00:32:13.964 --> 00:32:14.934
Where is my phone?

00:32:16.814 --> 00:32:17.644
What happened, ma'am?

00:32:17.734 --> 00:32:19.674
I kept my phone here.
Where is my phone?

00:32:27.884 --> 00:32:29.604
I don't know, ma'am.
I don't know.

00:32:31.284 --> 00:32:32.484
Check if it has fallen down.

00:32:33.034 --> 00:32:34.064
Check the floor, everyone.

00:32:35.024 --> 00:32:36.684
Wait, ma'am.
I will call your number.

00:32:38.384 --> 00:32:39.354
Do something, Reena.

00:32:43.164 --> 00:32:45.434
Ma'am, there is something.
Check there.

00:32:52.564 --> 00:32:54.954
Ma'am, it is here.

00:32:55.544 --> 00:32:56.984
I think you didn't see it properly.

00:32:59.364 --> 00:33:00.234
What?

00:33:00.894 --> 00:33:02.024
Sorry, guys.
- It's okay, ma'am.

00:33:04.374 --> 00:33:06.524
Anyway, welcome, Manasa.

00:33:06.854 --> 00:33:07.684
Thank you, sir.

00:33:09.124 --> 00:33:10.314
All the best.
- Thank you.

00:33:14.214 --> 00:33:15.234
1234..

00:33:15.694 --> 00:33:17.054
Whose birthday is it?

00:33:17.974 --> 00:33:18.814
It's just a number.

00:33:21.844 --> 00:33:23.684
Radhi has left.
What are these two doing?

00:33:26.424 --> 00:33:27.854
Did you get the phone?
- What happened - Did you take it?

00:33:28.264 --> 00:33:30.684
No, Teju. But I know
the password to the phone.

00:33:31.074 --> 00:33:32.434
What is it?
- 1234.

00:33:33.384 --> 00:33:34.524
Whose birthday is that?

00:33:34.794 --> 00:33:36.234
Why are you troubling me?

00:33:36.624 --> 00:33:37.434
Dr. Teju.

00:33:37.894 --> 00:33:40.224
Dr. Radhi asked you
to check on a patient in the ER.

00:33:40.324 --> 00:33:41.934
She will come after the meeting.

00:33:42.284 --> 00:33:43.514
Okay, I will come.

00:33:44.744 --> 00:33:46.644
Teju, everything is in your hands.

00:33:46.774 --> 00:33:48.094
Take the phone, go.

00:33:48.804 --> 00:33:51.604
Go..
- Go..

00:33:53.254 --> 00:33:56.044
The ward is full today.
You need to work more efficiently.

00:33:56.154 --> 00:33:58.014
If she sees me again,
she will find out.

00:33:58.694 --> 00:33:59.614
Who is going?

00:33:59.804 --> 00:34:00.854
Go, go.

00:34:03.174 --> 00:34:04.744
So, we have to be ready.

00:34:04.814 --> 00:34:05.674
Hi, ma'am.

00:34:05.994 --> 00:34:08.684
Whose file is this?
- Why are you doing this?

00:34:16.434 --> 00:34:19.394
She took it. Teju took the phone.
- Take this.

00:34:19.764 --> 00:34:21.894
Look.. check the number
- Hey, Rocky.

00:34:22.434 --> 00:34:23.514
Leave me.

00:34:25.624 --> 00:34:26.504
Check for 'Dad'.

00:34:26.654 --> 00:34:27.604
He is your grandfather, right?

00:34:27.654 --> 00:34:29.264
Oh, God..

00:34:29.314 --> 00:34:30.814
Hold this.
You and your family..

00:34:33.514 --> 00:34:34.304
What do I do..

00:34:36.774 --> 00:34:39.854
Hey, hurry up, check the number.

00:34:40.254 --> 00:34:42.304
Why does this keep
ending up with me?

00:34:43.694 --> 00:34:46.164
Why are you doing the face ID?
Enter the password, you fool.

00:34:46.714 --> 00:34:47.564
Password.

00:34:50.154 --> 00:34:51.314
Check for 'Daddy' or 'Dad'.
- Take it.

00:34:52.044 --> 00:34:54.144
Check his name.
- Where is my phone?

00:34:56.164 --> 00:34:57.434
Thyagarajan..

00:34:59.834 --> 00:35:02.014
Rocky, what are you doing
with my phone?

00:35:06.444 --> 00:35:09.244
Ma'am, the wallpaper was good.
So, I was looking at it.

00:35:12.674 --> 00:35:14.014
Why do you have my phone?

00:35:14.664 --> 00:35:16.644
How did you get
the phone from there?

00:35:17.424 --> 00:35:20.814
Don't you know how
I got the phone from there?

00:35:21.624 --> 00:35:22.484
Give me the phone.

00:35:24.444 --> 00:35:26.264
If she is grabbing
the phone so fast

00:35:26.634 --> 00:35:28.064
it's not just about
your grandfather's number.

00:35:28.284 --> 00:35:31.364
I think she has
hidden something else. - Keep quiet.

00:35:33.644 --> 00:35:36.034
Don't you know that it is wrong
to look at others' phones?

00:35:36.094 --> 00:35:38.894
Don't you know how strict the
disciplinary act of our hospital is?

00:35:41.224 --> 00:35:42.064
Ma'am.

00:35:42.674 --> 00:35:43.934
S-Sorry, ma'am.

00:35:45.394 --> 00:35:46.684
I asked him to take the phone.

00:35:50.304 --> 00:35:53.184
Then? You told me
to ask Mr. Thyagarajan.

00:35:53.684 --> 00:35:54.734
I don't have his number.

00:35:55.014 --> 00:35:56.464
So, I asked him to take it..

00:35:57.444 --> 00:35:58.814
Reena.
- Ma'am.

00:35:59.404 --> 00:36:00.274
Divi also didn't give it to me.

00:36:00.884 --> 00:36:02.764
Even Uncle Ganesh
doesn't have his new number.

00:36:03.384 --> 00:36:04.224
So..

00:36:05.184 --> 00:36:06.354
You want his number, right?

00:36:07.134 --> 00:36:08.484
You could have asked me, right?

00:36:13.454 --> 00:36:14.434
You witch.

00:36:16.434 --> 00:36:18.024
I have sent it.

00:36:22.434 --> 00:36:23.184
Idiots.

00:36:24.204 --> 00:36:25.684
You could have done this earlier.

00:36:26.074 --> 00:36:27.474
Our work is ruined because of you.

00:36:27.794 --> 00:36:29.184
I didn't expect this.

00:36:31.724 --> 00:36:33.484
Don't look at me like that
after all this.

00:36:36.734 --> 00:36:38.024
Thank you so much, Arjun.

00:36:39.454 --> 00:36:40.434
Are you happy now?

00:36:41.354 --> 00:36:42.184
Very much.

00:36:43.274 --> 00:36:46.014
I didn't expect this kind of help.

00:36:46.684 --> 00:36:47.524
Let's see.

00:36:47.604 --> 00:36:49.354
We haven't got
the official letter yet.

00:36:51.604 --> 00:36:53.274
Everyone has received you well.

00:36:53.394 --> 00:36:55.604
Then what?
You will get everything.

00:37:00.654 --> 00:37:01.524
Thank you.

00:37:02.354 --> 00:37:03.324
Why are you thanking me?

00:37:04.934 --> 00:37:07.334
You supported me and encouraged me.
That's why.

00:37:08.704 --> 00:37:10.644
It's okay.
You can go. Bye.

00:37:13.164 --> 00:37:14.024
See you.

00:38:25.603 --> 00:38:28.583
♪ Listen to the heart ♪

00:38:30.553 --> 00:38:33.033
♪ It beats lub-dub ♪

00:38:35.643 --> 00:38:38.703
♪ Even when patients panic ♪

00:38:40.223 --> 00:38:42.743
♪ Our patience wins ♪

00:38:42.853 --> 00:38:45.303
♪ Our duty is fun-filled ♪

00:38:45.403 --> 00:38:48.093
♪ Every day miracles occur ♪

00:38:48.153 --> 00:38:50.913
♪ I am a doctor ♪

00:38:53.043 --> 00:38:55.833
♪ I'm a two-legged booster ♪

00:38:58.083 --> 00:39:00.703
♪ Life is a theatre ♪

00:39:02.863 --> 00:39:07.213
♪ In it, I'm a doctor ♪

00:39:20.933 --> 00:39:21.913
Hi, Naveen.

00:39:23.633 --> 00:39:24.873
Why did you come here, Manasa?

00:39:26.623 --> 00:39:28.953
I thought you would
say hi and hug me.

00:39:30.083 --> 00:39:32.493
Why are you brothers
so angry with me?

00:39:33.993 --> 00:39:38.803
I want to spend time with you,
work and settle down here.

00:39:41.383 --> 00:39:45.003
I won't believe that
you are here only for that.

00:39:46.143 --> 00:39:49.123
Why? Can't I come here
to meet my family?

00:39:50.763 --> 00:39:52.413
I am saying that you
didn't come just for that.

00:39:52.873 --> 00:39:56.663
Madan was also obsessed with this
hospital and ruined himself.

00:39:57.183 --> 00:39:59.003
I hope you learn a lesson from him.

00:39:59.353 --> 00:40:01.893
Hey, don't compare me with him.

00:40:02.663 --> 00:40:05.703
I agree that I came here
for a few other reasons.

00:40:06.073 --> 00:40:07.033
What to do?

00:40:07.863 --> 00:40:09.723
One brother lost everything he had

00:40:09.823 --> 00:40:12.783
including his self-respect
and is begging Arjun for a job.

00:40:13.453 --> 00:40:14.743
My other brother

00:40:15.243 --> 00:40:17.303
has become a servant
to this hospital.

00:40:18.023 --> 00:40:20.463
Everything you do is disturbing.

00:40:21.003 --> 00:40:23.113
I feel bad.

00:40:23.503 --> 00:40:26.223
I am not being forced to do this.

00:40:26.513 --> 00:40:28.623
I like being here and I am happy.

00:40:30.223 --> 00:40:33.663
Madan has just accepted the reality

00:40:34.053 --> 00:40:37.503
and is going to start afresh.
Please don't spoil anything.

00:40:38.893 --> 00:40:43.203
Are you trying to hide
your identity or forget it?

00:40:46.073 --> 00:40:50.393
Okay, I will book
a slot for you first.

00:40:50.863 --> 00:40:52.283
Come and attend the counselling.

00:40:53.033 --> 00:40:54.613
You need it.

00:40:55.083 --> 00:40:58.283
Look Manasa, Arjun or Dr. Radhi.

00:40:58.723 --> 00:41:02.123
Even if one of them

00:41:02.713 --> 00:41:05.163
finds out the reason
why you are here..

00:41:06.703 --> 00:41:08.493
The consequences will be bad.

00:41:09.453 --> 00:41:10.493
Only if they find out.

00:41:11.253 --> 00:41:13.283
Why?
Are you going to tell them?

00:41:14.433 --> 00:41:16.263
If they find out,
you will also get caught.

00:41:16.933 --> 00:41:21.443
All the secrets you're trying
so hard to hide, will be revealed.

00:41:23.183 --> 00:41:25.683
What you both have done is enough.

00:41:26.373 --> 00:41:28.083
I won't say that I won't go back.

00:41:29.053 --> 00:41:30.783
But before that

00:41:31.243 --> 00:41:33.253
I will go back only after
returning this hospital to you.

00:41:34.113 --> 00:41:34.993
Do you understand?

00:41:35.773 --> 00:41:37.363
Okay, Brother, bye.

00:41:53.033 --> 00:41:55.333
Why are you staring at your phone?

00:41:59.053 --> 00:42:00.803
You asked for Thyagarajan's number.

00:42:01.103 --> 00:42:02.673
Why don't you call him?

00:42:04.053 --> 00:42:04.953
I don't know.

00:42:05.943 --> 00:42:07.533
It's true that I wanted an answer.

00:42:08.523 --> 00:42:10.353
But after it was revealed who I am

00:42:10.773 --> 00:42:13.903
he is the only one who
did not get angry with me.

00:42:15.503 --> 00:42:19.223
What if he doesn't talk to me
after I confront him?

00:42:20.493 --> 00:42:23.103
What if it affects our bond?

00:42:25.153 --> 00:42:28.783
And I don't know
if I should believe my mom.

00:42:29.513 --> 00:42:30.813
I mean..

00:42:31.423 --> 00:42:37.033
Instead of pondering in silence
over whether to call him or not.

00:42:37.843 --> 00:42:39.203
Just talk to him.

00:42:43.223 --> 00:42:44.883
I will talk to him.
You can go.

00:42:46.023 --> 00:42:48.313
Okay, I can understand that.
Good night.

00:43:16.143 --> 00:43:17.913
Hello, I'm Reena.

00:43:19.133 --> 00:43:20.723
I knew that you'd call me.

00:43:22.023 --> 00:43:24.953
So, you know
why I called you, right?

00:43:28.563 --> 00:43:29.403
Dr. Radhi told me

00:43:29.473 --> 00:43:31.823
that you are the reason why
I ended up in an orphanage.

00:43:32.733 --> 00:43:33.653
Why?

00:43:34.033 --> 00:43:35.243
Why did you do this?

00:43:36.443 --> 00:43:38.603
If you can be a grandfather
to Sid and Divi

00:43:39.993 --> 00:43:40.923
why not me?

00:43:42.373 --> 00:43:43.563
Why didn't you accept me?

00:43:44.913 --> 00:43:46.583
I didn't do anything wrong.

00:43:47.663 --> 00:43:50.193
The other day, you said
that I didn't do anything wrong

00:43:50.503 --> 00:43:51.963
and that you were
not angry with me.

00:43:53.093 --> 00:43:56.473
But you have punished me.
- Reena.

00:43:58.993 --> 00:44:02.413
Your feelings right now..

00:44:03.603 --> 00:44:05.583
I can understand that.

00:44:05.773 --> 00:44:06.683
Then, tell me.

00:44:09.043 --> 00:44:10.073
I will definitely tell you.

00:44:11.483 --> 00:44:14.833
I have come here
for an important work.

00:44:15.733 --> 00:44:16.863
Once it's done..

00:44:18.073 --> 00:44:19.453
I will tell you in person.

00:44:19.543 --> 00:44:22.123
Why?
Why can't you tell me now?

00:44:22.863 --> 00:44:26.003
Reena, it is not something
to share over the phone.

00:44:28.373 --> 00:44:30.783
It has taken me so many years
to get close to Dr. Radhi.

00:44:32.003 --> 00:44:34.723
It has taken a year for her to tell
me that you have the answer I want.

00:44:35.733 --> 00:44:38.043
I thought you will answer me.

00:44:38.843 --> 00:44:40.383
But you are asking for time.

00:44:41.373 --> 00:44:42.203
Reena..

00:44:43.213 --> 00:44:45.663
Please believe me.

00:44:47.563 --> 00:44:51.913
You will definitely get
all the answers to your questions.

00:44:53.693 --> 00:44:55.073
I guarantee you that.

00:45:07.743 --> 00:45:10.163
Why couldn't he say it right then?

00:45:10.753 --> 00:45:12.393
Is it something to tell me
in person, it seems.

00:45:13.043 --> 00:45:16.343
I don't think he was in a situation
where he can't tell you.

00:45:16.673 --> 00:45:20.623
I think he is trying to hide it
just like Dr. Radhi.

00:45:21.303 --> 00:45:23.483
He has promised me
that he will tell me.

00:45:23.783 --> 00:45:24.763
Oh, great.

00:45:25.333 --> 00:45:26.203
I believe him.

00:45:26.693 --> 00:45:29.453
Believe him. I will get to work.
- Get lost.

00:45:33.153 --> 00:45:35.663
Log these details into the computer.
- Okay, sir.

00:45:40.953 --> 00:45:42.373
Hi, Arjun.
- Hi.

00:45:46.283 --> 00:45:48.743
Have you selected the psychiatrist?

00:45:49.453 --> 00:45:50.513
Are the interviews over?

00:45:51.873 --> 00:45:54.673
The one who was sitting there when
you came in that day is the one.

00:45:55.743 --> 00:45:56.623
Her name is Manasa.

00:45:57.293 --> 00:45:58.193
Oh.

00:45:59.163 --> 00:46:00.403
Is she someone you know?

00:46:07.543 --> 00:46:09.963
We met a few days ago
at a coffee shop.

00:46:10.993 --> 00:46:11.843
Oh.

00:46:11.913 --> 00:46:14.243
So, the psychologist
came in search of you.

00:46:14.353 --> 00:46:16.353
But you didn't go
in search of the psychologist.

00:46:21.313 --> 00:46:22.203
Not only that.

00:46:22.323 --> 00:46:24.953
I was the one who dropped her
when she went for an interview.

00:46:25.283 --> 00:46:27.663
She missed the interview
because of me.

00:46:27.673 --> 00:46:28.673
Oh.

00:46:47.003 --> 00:46:50.703
You went on a date with Kiran.

00:46:51.383 --> 00:46:52.293
What happened?

00:46:53.783 --> 00:46:55.623
It was superb.

00:46:55.883 --> 00:46:57.283
I enjoyed it a lot.

00:46:59.653 --> 00:47:00.483
Okay.

00:47:00.523 --> 00:47:03.313
We had tea, samosa,
bread omelette and puffs.

00:47:03.573 --> 00:47:04.833
Everything was superb.

00:47:04.963 --> 00:47:06.693
He asked me to go to the beach.

00:47:07.203 --> 00:47:09.513
I went there since he insisted.

00:47:09.783 --> 00:47:11.583
We had a good time
talking to each other.

00:47:11.743 --> 00:47:14.543
We had a lot of fun.

00:47:16.253 --> 00:47:17.083
Is it?

00:47:18.213 --> 00:47:20.713
Kamal told me that you
didn't go to the beach.

00:47:22.753 --> 00:47:24.813
It's me who went.
How would he know?

00:47:26.313 --> 00:47:27.453
Where was that tea shop?

00:47:28.433 --> 00:47:30.253
Are you going to take Manasa there?

00:47:32.353 --> 00:47:33.253
Oh, no.

00:47:33.723 --> 00:47:35.343
I didn't think of this idea.

00:47:35.663 --> 00:47:36.743
It's a great idea, Reena.

00:47:37.023 --> 00:47:39.483
She wanted to treat me
to a dinner after she gets a job.

00:47:40.313 --> 00:47:42.783
Okay, tell me the location.
I will ask her.

00:47:44.463 --> 00:47:46.833
Their cream bun is good.
Buy it for her.

00:47:47.773 --> 00:47:49.163
Done. Sure.

00:47:49.843 --> 00:47:50.663
Sure..

00:47:58.043 --> 00:47:58.903
Reena.

00:48:00.763 --> 00:48:04.783
Are we friend-zoned?

00:48:06.503 --> 00:48:08.443
Yes, we are friends.

00:48:09.743 --> 00:48:10.643
Yes.

00:48:11.343 --> 00:48:13.183
We are friends..

00:48:23.433 --> 00:48:25.743
Dad, is this correct?

00:48:27.723 --> 00:48:28.833
How many times should I tell you?

00:48:29.863 --> 00:48:32.073
Write it correctly..
I taught you, right?

00:48:35.903 --> 00:48:37.763
Sorry, Dad. I forgot it.

00:48:38.413 --> 00:48:39.323
What do you mean?

00:48:40.753 --> 00:48:44.413
Didn't you listen to me?
How could you do this, Divi?

00:48:45.923 --> 00:48:48.773
I've been observing you.
Your focus is only on the games.

00:48:49.553 --> 00:48:51.363
You are going swimming,
playing with Sid.

00:48:52.283 --> 00:48:53.973
But you never study, right?

00:48:54.723 --> 00:48:57.283
If you keep this up, your classmates
will advance to the next grade.

00:48:57.763 --> 00:48:59.353
Then you will have to be retained.

00:49:02.023 --> 00:49:02.903
Divi.

00:49:03.943 --> 00:49:05.033
Go inside and study.

00:49:05.773 --> 00:49:06.673
Go.

00:49:14.903 --> 00:49:16.093
What happened to you, Dev?

00:49:18.453 --> 00:49:19.543
Why are you doing this?

00:49:21.663 --> 00:49:24.333
You used to scold me
whenever I scold the kids.

00:49:24.603 --> 00:49:26.623
But you are getting
so angry with Divi now.

00:49:29.463 --> 00:49:32.093
Kids are observing what
is happening between us.

00:49:32.473 --> 00:49:33.983
They understand everything.

00:49:34.133 --> 00:49:36.603
It's a big deal to have
so much understanding at this age.

00:49:38.103 --> 00:49:42.033
It's not right to do this just
because you are here for the kids.

00:49:42.813 --> 00:49:44.353
Please listen to me.

00:49:45.553 --> 00:49:47.163
Let's sit and discuss.

00:49:47.403 --> 00:49:48.953
Everything will be fine
if we talk it out.

00:49:50.323 --> 00:49:51.153
Look.

00:49:52.033 --> 00:49:54.323
I haven't moved on from
what happened that night.

00:49:55.283 --> 00:49:57.953
How can I talk to you when
I can't come out of the past?

00:49:59.493 --> 00:50:00.623
I can't do it.

00:50:21.483 --> 00:50:22.593
Naveen.

00:50:22.703 --> 00:50:24.533
Your behaviour is
not good these days.

00:50:25.233 --> 00:50:26.163
Why?

00:50:27.483 --> 00:50:29.493
You used to get excited
whenever you see me.

00:50:30.243 --> 00:50:32.263
But now, I think
you are pretending to work.

00:50:32.363 --> 00:50:34.333
I am not pretending,
I am just doing my job.

00:50:35.503 --> 00:50:36.833
Then, why is your voice like this?

00:50:38.433 --> 00:50:39.333
It's good.

00:50:42.743 --> 00:50:43.563
Okay.

00:50:43.963 --> 00:50:45.633
What were you talking
to that psychologist about?

00:50:49.923 --> 00:50:51.603
I know this look.

00:50:52.383 --> 00:50:53.303
What are you hiding now?

00:50:59.103 --> 00:51:00.303
Okay.

00:51:02.103 --> 00:51:04.153
You will find out
even if I don't tell you.

00:51:06.483 --> 00:51:07.353
I will tell you.

00:51:07.773 --> 00:51:08.683
What?

00:51:08.853 --> 00:51:11.073
Her name is Manasa.

00:51:13.263 --> 00:51:14.333
She is no one else.

00:51:14.903 --> 00:51:15.823
She is my sister.

00:51:17.863 --> 00:51:18.733
Hey.

00:51:20.033 --> 00:51:21.283
How many siblings do you have?

00:51:21.533 --> 00:51:22.743
There's no end to it.

00:51:22.893 --> 00:51:24.573
No, just the three of us.

00:51:26.733 --> 00:51:27.663
Oh.

00:51:29.043 --> 00:51:30.703
So, you are MNM.

00:51:32.443 --> 00:51:33.413
Alright.

00:51:35.123 --> 00:51:36.243
Is your father..

00:51:37.183 --> 00:51:38.703
Did he name the company
after you were born?

00:51:38.743 --> 00:51:40.493
Or did he name you
after the company?

00:51:40.683 --> 00:51:41.533
Teju.

00:51:43.813 --> 00:51:45.013
What does your sister want?

00:51:45.683 --> 00:51:46.653
Why is she here?

00:51:47.843 --> 00:51:48.833
She has moved to Chennai.

00:51:49.773 --> 00:51:51.263
She was looking for a job.

00:51:51.563 --> 00:51:52.623
Now, she has joined here.

00:51:54.233 --> 00:51:56.383
You three are a waste.

00:51:57.803 --> 00:51:58.673
Why?

00:51:59.363 --> 00:52:01.633
If I was born in the MNM family

00:52:02.583 --> 00:52:04.413
and if I was
a psychologist like Manasa

00:52:04.533 --> 00:52:07.143
I would have entered
the hospital like this

00:52:07.203 --> 00:52:09.873
and devised a plan to get it back.

00:52:13.183 --> 00:52:14.413
Why are you staring at me?

00:52:15.583 --> 00:52:17.123
Is that your actual plan?

00:52:21.883 --> 00:52:22.743
Okay.

00:52:24.183 --> 00:52:26.613
You will find this out
even if I don't tell you.

00:52:27.703 --> 00:52:28.833
I will tell you this too.

00:52:29.133 --> 00:52:30.623
Tell me before
I beat you to a pulp.

00:52:31.813 --> 00:52:34.573
Actually, she is trying
to take this hospital back.

00:52:34.733 --> 00:52:35.773
That's why she is here.

00:52:37.743 --> 00:52:40.953
She can easily
manipulate everyone here.

00:52:42.033 --> 00:52:44.783
Her job is to give counselling
to the workers here.

00:52:45.533 --> 00:52:46.913
Her job will make it easier.

00:52:47.333 --> 00:52:48.493
Oh, God..

00:52:49.043 --> 00:52:51.033
I will do anything
to stop her, Teju.

00:52:51.213 --> 00:52:52.413
I will go to any extreme.

00:52:54.613 --> 00:52:56.663
Teju, will you help me in this?

00:52:58.013 --> 00:52:58.963
Get lost.

00:52:59.973 --> 00:53:01.833
You, your sister, your brother..

00:53:02.053 --> 00:53:05.163
I don't care what happens
to anyone in this hospital.

00:53:05.393 --> 00:53:06.333
Do you understand?

00:53:06.893 --> 00:53:08.493
I have my own clinic.

00:53:08.773 --> 00:53:11.193
Teju, why are you
talking like this?

00:53:12.063 --> 00:53:13.233
You'd ask me to save you now.

00:53:13.313 --> 00:53:15.073
After saving you,
you would kick me out.

00:53:16.863 --> 00:53:17.733
Get lost.

00:53:18.153 --> 00:53:19.843
I don't want your friendship.

00:53:20.823 --> 00:53:23.533
Teju, please.
- I will kill you.

00:53:30.933 --> 00:53:32.623
Hi, ma'am.
- Hello.

00:53:32.663 --> 00:53:34.413
Good morning, Doctor.
- Good morning, Nurse.

00:53:34.673 --> 00:53:37.673
Everyone has practised well
and we are ready to dance.

00:53:37.863 --> 00:53:39.453
It will be fun.

00:53:39.523 --> 00:53:42.333
But, Doctor..
Can she dance in this condition?

00:53:42.843 --> 00:53:45.893
Oh, no, don't talk like this
when Guna is around.

00:53:46.223 --> 00:53:49.453
Then he'll do everything
to stop me.

00:53:49.563 --> 00:53:50.563
Okay, ma'am.

00:53:50.643 --> 00:53:52.483
She is not in bad shape, Nurse.

00:53:52.573 --> 00:53:54.883
She is just weak.
That's why we give her medicines.

00:53:55.023 --> 00:53:55.883
That's it.

00:53:55.983 --> 00:53:58.153
I have asked some doctors
for a second opinion.

00:53:58.573 --> 00:54:00.583
Nothing to worry.
She can handle it.

00:54:02.283 --> 00:54:04.003
Anitha, where are we
going to dance tomorrow?

00:54:04.323 --> 00:54:06.833
Tomorrow is our hospital's
anniversary event.

00:54:07.003 --> 00:54:09.873
So, Arjun said that we
can dance in that event.

00:54:10.333 --> 00:54:11.183
Oh.

00:54:11.543 --> 00:54:16.513
So, are you going to pre-promote
your hospital by dancing with me?

00:54:21.383 --> 00:54:23.403
There will be a lot
of people in the hospital.

00:54:24.053 --> 00:54:26.163
I have to get ready beautifully.

00:54:26.593 --> 00:54:29.763
My hairstyle, my make-up
and everything should look good.

00:54:30.473 --> 00:54:31.713
Your wish is my command.

00:54:52.833 --> 00:54:54.463
Reena.
- Reena.

00:55:01.793 --> 00:55:02.913
I want to talk to Reena.

00:55:03.463 --> 00:55:04.633
And you are interrupting us.

00:55:05.133 --> 00:55:06.743
Oh, sorry, sir.

00:55:07.223 --> 00:55:08.333
But this is a bit important.

00:55:10.113 --> 00:55:12.083
What happened?
Is there any emergency?

00:55:12.213 --> 00:55:14.033
There is no emergency.
But it is important.

00:55:15.183 --> 00:55:18.163
Just like last year, you are coming
to the event in a sari, right?

00:55:21.903 --> 00:55:25.483
Yes. Not just me, everyone
will come in ethnic wear.

00:55:26.013 --> 00:55:27.783
I don't care what others wear.

00:55:28.653 --> 00:55:30.663
By the way,
what colour sari are you wearing?

00:55:31.953 --> 00:55:33.913
Why are you so interested
in the dress code?

00:55:34.393 --> 00:55:36.783
You keep on asking me
what colour dress I'm wearing.

00:55:37.013 --> 00:55:38.333
Just tell me.

00:55:40.503 --> 00:55:41.713
I am thinking of wearing red.

00:55:42.993 --> 00:55:45.443
Red..
Red denotes love.

00:55:46.383 --> 00:55:47.223
Right?

00:55:48.663 --> 00:55:49.583
Right?

00:55:49.703 --> 00:55:52.033
You would have said the same
thing no matter what colour I said.

00:55:52.693 --> 00:55:53.833
You are great.

00:55:54.393 --> 00:55:55.503
Wear that.

00:55:55.933 --> 00:55:58.393
I will also come in red.

00:55:59.313 --> 00:56:00.243
Bye, Reena.

00:56:00.583 --> 00:56:01.453
Thank you, sir.

00:56:05.653 --> 00:56:07.153
Is this your important matter?

00:56:07.823 --> 00:56:08.873
This is important to me.

00:56:09.483 --> 00:56:10.333
Bye, sir.

00:56:10.693 --> 00:56:11.623
Bye, Reena.

00:56:15.283 --> 00:56:16.243
Tell me, Arjun.

00:56:16.683 --> 00:56:19.333
You said you wanted to talk to me.
What is the matter?

00:56:19.983 --> 00:56:21.743
That is..
- Arjun.

00:56:26.693 --> 00:56:27.593
Oh!

00:56:28.513 --> 00:56:29.413
Hi, Manasa.

00:56:29.753 --> 00:56:30.623
Hi.

00:56:30.923 --> 00:56:32.933
I was looking for you.
- Oh!

00:56:33.973 --> 00:56:35.033
You were looking for me?

00:56:36.463 --> 00:56:37.373
I'm coming.

00:56:40.733 --> 00:56:42.763
I heard it is the hospital's
anniversary. - Yes.

00:56:43.223 --> 00:56:46.743
It is an annual event.

00:56:46.913 --> 00:56:50.603
Come, I will explain
everything to you in detail.

00:56:51.583 --> 00:56:52.403
Okay?

00:56:53.493 --> 00:56:56.703
Which colour sari
do you plan to wear?

00:56:57.353 --> 00:56:58.533
She is quite tall.

00:56:59.413 --> 00:57:01.443
Arjun!
'Get lost.'

00:57:25.563 --> 00:57:26.413
Hello.

00:57:27.243 --> 00:57:28.703
Yes.
Hi, Mr. Preetham.

00:57:29.233 --> 00:57:30.533
Manasa, right?
- Yes.

00:57:30.893 --> 00:57:33.713
Congratulations. Welcome
to RK Hospital. - Thank you.

00:57:34.943 --> 00:57:36.123
Is the cabin okay? All set?

00:57:36.323 --> 00:57:38.493
Yes, I am setting it up.
Sit down, let's talk.

00:57:42.773 --> 00:57:43.873
So..

00:57:44.573 --> 00:57:45.533
Manasa..

00:57:46.513 --> 00:57:50.123
Before this, you worked at the Mental
Health Hospital, Bangalore, right?

00:57:52.373 --> 00:57:53.243
Yes.

00:57:53.913 --> 00:57:55.123
What a small world!

00:57:55.763 --> 00:57:59.783
Their chief doctor, Isaac,
is a very close friend of mine.

00:58:00.973 --> 00:58:02.263
I spoke to him about you.

00:58:03.603 --> 00:58:07.013
He told me a lot about what
you have done in that hospital

00:58:08.213 --> 00:58:11.993
and what you have done
to that hospital.

00:58:12.743 --> 00:58:13.833
He has told me everything.

00:58:15.283 --> 00:58:18.413
Before you went there,
the hospital was doing well.

00:58:19.473 --> 00:58:20.583
After you joined

00:58:20.953 --> 00:58:22.743
the hospital chair fell through

00:58:23.313 --> 00:58:24.993
and another hospital bought it.

00:58:26.083 --> 00:58:27.153
Why is that?

00:58:29.003 --> 00:58:30.373
What can I do about that?

00:58:31.013 --> 00:58:31.883
No..

00:58:32.303 --> 00:58:36.713
The hospital chair fell through
and you quit that hospital

00:58:37.243 --> 00:58:38.663
more or less at the same time.

00:58:39.213 --> 00:58:40.453
What a coincidence, right?

00:58:41.013 --> 00:58:42.493
That's why I enquired in detail.

00:58:45.783 --> 00:58:47.283
You are Madan's sister, right?

00:58:49.693 --> 00:58:51.233
Why are you talking about that now?

00:58:52.233 --> 00:58:53.083
Look..

00:58:53.893 --> 00:58:57.413
You are not here
just to be a psychologist.

00:58:58.243 --> 00:59:01.273
I know what you
are going to do here.

00:59:02.993 --> 00:59:04.373
I don't care about that.

00:59:07.213 --> 00:59:08.193
But..

00:59:10.253 --> 00:59:11.683
You have to do me a favour.

00:59:13.623 --> 00:59:14.533
What is that?

00:59:15.363 --> 00:59:19.483
Radhi should leave
this hospital for good.

00:59:20.663 --> 00:59:22.743
She shouldn't come
back for any reason.

00:59:24.133 --> 00:59:25.583
You have to get it done.

00:59:26.983 --> 00:59:27.953
Why?

00:59:28.943 --> 00:59:30.873
Did I ask you why you did all that?

00:59:36.203 --> 00:59:37.873
Okay, sir.
I won't ask you.

00:59:39.033 --> 00:59:40.783
This is an advantage for me too.

00:59:41.303 --> 00:59:44.033
So.. I can help you if you need.

00:59:46.543 --> 00:59:48.203
Let's do it as a team together.

00:59:49.043 --> 00:59:51.163
Thank you and welcome again.

01:00:55.138 --> 01:00:58.458
♪ Listen to the heart ♪

01:01:00.148 --> 01:01:02.668
♪ It beats lub-dub ♪

01:01:05.178 --> 01:01:08.168
♪ Even when patients panic ♪

01:01:09.908 --> 01:01:11.778
♪ Our patience wins ♪

01:01:12.408 --> 01:01:14.898
♪ Our duty is fun-filled ♪

01:01:14.988 --> 01:01:17.448
♪ Every day miracles occur ♪

01:01:17.748 --> 01:01:20.498
♪ I am a doctor ♪

01:01:22.618 --> 01:01:25.328
♪ I'm a two-legged booster ♪

01:01:27.708 --> 01:01:30.458
♪ Life is a theatre ♪

01:01:32.478 --> 01:01:36.928
♪ In it, I'm a doctor ♪

01:02:43.788 --> 01:02:44.678
Do one thing.
- Sir.

01:02:44.778 --> 01:02:48.088
Take the sofas and chairs away.
- Okay, sir.

01:02:48.208 --> 01:02:51.418
And then take this desk away too.

01:02:51.668 --> 01:02:53.278
Because the event
is going to happen here.

01:02:53.378 --> 01:02:54.628
Keep the chairs in that area

01:02:54.758 --> 01:02:56.888
so that the audience can see
the performances here.

01:02:57.038 --> 01:02:59.328
Okay, make it quick.
- Sure, sir.

01:03:01.018 --> 01:03:01.878
Hi.

01:03:03.478 --> 01:03:04.838
Update these files.

01:03:05.308 --> 01:03:06.178
Hi..

01:03:10.228 --> 01:03:11.398
The sari looks good.

01:03:12.698 --> 01:03:13.838
But the colour is not good.

01:03:18.828 --> 01:03:21.288
Arjun, are you okay
with these decorations?

01:03:21.828 --> 01:03:23.358
There won't be any problem, right?

01:03:23.668 --> 01:03:26.508
I'll make sure that
there is no problem.

01:03:27.778 --> 01:03:29.128
Guna is my friend too.

01:03:29.748 --> 01:03:31.498
I want to do something for him.

01:03:39.728 --> 01:03:42.538
By the way,
how was the dance practice?

01:03:42.618 --> 01:03:44.498
It was good.

01:03:49.108 --> 01:03:50.028
Reena.

01:03:51.158 --> 01:03:52.838
Did you ask Manasa
if she knows how to dance?

01:03:53.858 --> 01:03:55.918
Because she has just joined us.

01:03:56.168 --> 01:03:58.538
So it will be
the right time to mingle.

01:03:58.948 --> 01:04:00.538
If she is interested

01:04:00.838 --> 01:04:03.078
you can include her
in your dance performance.

01:04:04.288 --> 01:04:06.068
Even if Manasa is not interested

01:04:06.248 --> 01:04:09.218
it looks like someone is very
interested to see her dance.

01:04:11.038 --> 01:04:13.848
Why don't we include the patients
who are admitted here as well?

01:04:18.678 --> 01:04:19.488
Reena!

01:04:20.218 --> 01:04:21.788
Are you going to invite Manasa?

01:04:22.008 --> 01:04:24.898
No, I am going to invite
the patients. - Oh..

01:04:26.378 --> 01:04:28.088
The file?
- You keep it.

01:04:31.538 --> 01:04:32.328
Oh.

01:04:37.758 --> 01:04:38.758
Was it like this?

01:04:43.508 --> 01:04:44.378
Hi.

01:04:45.118 --> 01:04:46.958
What?
Are you very busy?

01:04:47.248 --> 01:04:48.068
Yes.

01:04:48.368 --> 01:04:50.458
Reena is giving me a lot of work.

01:04:51.668 --> 01:04:54.408
Hey, what did my father tell you
when you spoke to him?

01:04:55.378 --> 01:04:56.218
Why?

01:04:56.628 --> 01:04:57.608
What did he say?

01:04:57.968 --> 01:04:59.338
He must have been so shocked.

01:04:59.798 --> 01:05:01.118
I told him everything about me.

01:05:01.538 --> 01:05:03.868
I told him everything
about me and my family.

01:05:04.518 --> 01:05:07.778
I told him I was
average in studies

01:05:07.808 --> 01:05:11.078
and that I am very
short-tempered.

01:05:11.358 --> 01:05:14.518
After this, I swear
that he would never like me.

01:05:14.898 --> 01:05:16.228
I don't know what you told him.

01:05:16.358 --> 01:05:19.628
But after meeting you, not only
my dad, even my family.. - Wow!

01:05:19.948 --> 01:05:21.188
Even your family doesn't like me?

01:05:21.318 --> 01:05:23.668
No, my family likes you a lot.

01:05:23.778 --> 01:05:26.528
They said that choosing you was the
best decision I took in my life.

01:05:26.648 --> 01:05:28.118
They praised me a lot.

01:05:28.908 --> 01:05:29.938
They praised you?

01:05:30.418 --> 01:05:31.458
What kind of a family is this?

01:05:32.458 --> 01:05:35.288
Not only that,
my father liked you a lot.

01:05:35.618 --> 01:05:38.538
He said that you are
very genuine and honest.

01:05:39.628 --> 01:05:40.928
I should have put my guard up

01:05:41.068 --> 01:05:44.038
when your dad sent me
a good morning message.

01:05:45.288 --> 01:05:46.248
It's my fault.

01:05:47.888 --> 01:05:48.728
Okay.

01:05:49.348 --> 01:05:51.008
You met my family.

01:05:51.628 --> 01:05:52.968
You spoke to my father.

01:05:53.738 --> 01:05:56.578
I am sure they would have
told you something about me.

01:05:57.488 --> 01:06:01.148
Have you ever wondered why
you didn't see me in that light?

01:06:01.848 --> 01:06:03.778
No.. What is this, Nilofer?

01:06:04.048 --> 01:06:04.958
You are my bro.

01:06:06.038 --> 01:06:08.108
The vibe I have
with you is different.

01:06:08.998 --> 01:06:11.978
In fact, most of the time
I forget that you are a girl.

01:06:12.708 --> 01:06:14.998
Because the vibe
between us is like that.

01:06:18.548 --> 01:06:19.738
Why did you ask that?

01:06:20.468 --> 01:06:24.138
Do you feel anything?
- Hey, no..

01:06:24.468 --> 01:06:26.668
It's nothing like that.
You talk to my family

01:06:26.848 --> 01:06:27.708
and hang out with my father.

01:06:27.768 --> 01:06:30.518
So I wanted to make sure
that you don't catch any feelings.

01:06:32.058 --> 01:06:34.928
Okay?
- You don't have to worry about it.

01:06:35.308 --> 01:06:37.128
Because I won't catch any feelings.

01:06:37.358 --> 01:06:38.318
You also won't, right?

01:06:40.088 --> 01:06:40.958
Then it's okay.

01:06:41.098 --> 01:06:42.328
Okay, get out.

01:06:42.738 --> 01:06:43.598
Why should I go out?

01:06:43.718 --> 01:06:45.998
I have to practice my dance.
I can't do it if you are here.

01:06:46.508 --> 01:06:48.708
You are going to dance
in front of us, right?

01:06:48.868 --> 01:06:49.698
I will see you then.

01:07:25.318 --> 01:07:28.458
Aruna, why do you look so dull?

01:07:29.788 --> 01:07:30.648
It's nothing.

01:07:31.808 --> 01:07:32.928
Is there a problem?

01:07:34.758 --> 01:07:37.528
Life is full of
sorrows and difficulties.

01:07:38.368 --> 01:07:42.168
Even when we try to go through
each day with hope

01:07:42.718 --> 01:07:47.038
something happens
to make it difficult now and then.

01:07:49.678 --> 01:07:50.658
What happened, Aruna?

01:07:51.218 --> 01:07:52.448
What else should happen?

01:07:53.478 --> 01:07:57.788
Every groom who comes to see me
gives some excuses to reject me.

01:07:59.018 --> 01:08:01.688
But after all this, when I
finally found a person for me

01:08:01.978 --> 01:08:06.418
I felt relieved
that he'd be there for me.

01:08:06.708 --> 01:08:09.328
But he also said that he
doesn't want to get married.

01:08:10.658 --> 01:08:12.458
We've invited everyone already.

01:08:12.738 --> 01:08:14.288
My wedding
was supposed to be next week.

01:08:14.938 --> 01:08:16.538
But now they have
cancelled the wedding.

01:08:19.338 --> 01:08:20.858
I don't know what to do.

01:08:40.868 --> 01:08:43.958
Hey, Elango, where are you?
Come out!

01:08:44.648 --> 01:08:46.078
You got me in trouble.

01:08:46.168 --> 01:08:48.788
Come out! Are you coming out
or should I come in?

01:08:50.018 --> 01:08:52.578
Amaya, someone has come
looking for me.

01:08:52.638 --> 01:08:53.708
Tell him that I am not here.

01:08:54.118 --> 01:08:56.248
Who is it?
- Come out!

01:08:56.328 --> 01:08:57.358
Please.

01:08:57.618 --> 01:08:59.368
What did you do today?

01:08:59.518 --> 01:09:01.038
You're always causing trouble.

01:09:01.288 --> 01:09:02.268
You little..

01:09:03.958 --> 01:09:06.588
Hey! Where are you?

01:09:06.818 --> 01:09:08.758
Please.
- I will talk to him.

01:09:10.388 --> 01:09:11.898
Hey, Elango.

01:09:12.218 --> 01:09:13.108
Come out.

01:09:15.178 --> 01:09:16.888
Sir, who are you?

01:09:17.288 --> 01:09:18.378
Why are you shouting?

01:09:18.648 --> 01:09:20.258
Is this Elango's house?

01:09:20.328 --> 01:09:21.638
Yes, he is my father.

01:09:21.918 --> 01:09:23.288
Ask him to come out.

01:09:24.418 --> 01:09:25.498
Who are you, sir?

01:09:26.058 --> 01:09:26.918
Madam.

01:09:27.358 --> 01:09:30.618
Look, your father comes
to my club every day to gamble.

01:09:30.698 --> 01:09:33.628
He ran away without paying.
I am the owner of that club.

01:09:33.748 --> 01:09:36.388
People who played there
are asking me for money.

01:09:36.688 --> 01:09:39.788
I have given my money because
of your father, do you understand?

01:09:39.958 --> 01:09:40.848
Call him.

01:09:41.628 --> 01:09:42.898
How much does he owe you?

01:09:43.798 --> 01:09:44.918
Rs. 4 lakhs.

01:09:49.418 --> 01:09:52.818
Rs. 4 lakhs?
Sir, we don't have so much money.

01:09:53.138 --> 01:09:57.128
We've already pledged this house,
how can we arrange such a sum?

01:09:57.278 --> 01:09:58.938
What do you want me
to do about that?

01:09:59.348 --> 01:10:01.708
Sir, give us some time.

01:10:01.878 --> 01:10:04.128
I will return everything
little by little.

01:10:04.688 --> 01:10:07.328
Please, sir.
Give me some time.

01:10:09.208 --> 01:10:11.708
Look here.
You have two months' time.

01:10:12.028 --> 01:10:15.078
If I don't get my money by then,
the consequences will be bad.

01:10:15.288 --> 01:10:16.358
Do you understand?

01:10:17.328 --> 01:10:18.568
Go and tell your father.

01:10:20.158 --> 01:10:21.878
I will see for how
long he can hide.

01:10:50.808 --> 01:10:51.748
Hey.

01:10:58.218 --> 01:10:59.048
What happened?

01:11:00.118 --> 01:11:02.768
I feel like I shouldn't
have asked my grandfather.

01:11:04.128 --> 01:11:07.578
Reena, don't overthink it
and blabber like a fool.

01:11:07.838 --> 01:11:11.428
No, he said he'd call me
back when I called him.

01:11:11.748 --> 01:11:13.628
But he hasn't called me till now.

01:11:14.948 --> 01:11:16.418
He might have been busy.

01:11:17.128 --> 01:11:17.958
No.

01:11:18.598 --> 01:11:21.258
I tried calling him,
but he was unreachable.

01:11:21.618 --> 01:11:23.788
His phone is always engaged.
What does that mean?

01:11:27.358 --> 01:11:30.898
Maybe if I hadn't asked him

01:11:32.438 --> 01:11:35.408
everything would have been
normal between us like before.

01:11:35.838 --> 01:11:41.738
But now, I don't know
if he will talk to me properly.

01:12:28.998 --> 01:12:32.128
Have you noticed Dr. Anitha
and Guna? - What about them?

01:12:32.778 --> 01:12:34.878
They are very close now.

01:12:35.418 --> 01:12:37.868
Dr. Anitha's friend,
Dr. Ravi is also not here.

01:12:38.018 --> 01:12:40.248
Now she is working with Dr. Guna.

01:12:40.378 --> 01:12:42.168
So it's normal
for them to be close.

01:12:42.378 --> 01:12:43.418
What's the big deal?

01:12:43.718 --> 01:12:47.238
Their interaction is different
when there are people around.

01:12:47.848 --> 01:12:51.038
When there is no one around,
they behave differently.

01:12:51.508 --> 01:12:52.538
Did you see that?

01:12:52.688 --> 01:12:54.688
Would I have told you
if I hadn't seen it?

01:12:55.058 --> 01:12:59.578
When alone, Dr. Guna's way
of talking to Anitha is different.

01:13:42.158 --> 01:13:43.078
Hi, Mom.

01:13:44.308 --> 01:13:45.288
Hi.

01:13:45.648 --> 01:13:47.668
Mom, when are you going to dance?

01:13:47.728 --> 01:13:48.918
In a while.

01:13:51.868 --> 01:13:53.078
Thanks for coming, Dev.

01:13:54.738 --> 01:13:57.878
Radhi, I think we need to talk.

01:14:06.388 --> 01:14:08.268
I thought about what
you said yesterday.

01:14:09.758 --> 01:14:10.878
What you said is right.

01:14:12.138 --> 01:14:15.208
I promised you that I will be
with you till the kids understand.

01:14:15.778 --> 01:14:16.998
But as you said

01:14:17.098 --> 01:14:18.998
they can understand
what is happening now.

01:14:20.448 --> 01:14:23.528
And practically speaking, I can't
live in the same house as you.

01:14:25.548 --> 01:14:27.168
I was thinking about
this for a long time.

01:14:29.388 --> 01:14:34.618
And I realised my mistake
only after you pointed it out.

01:14:36.308 --> 01:14:39.288
If I stay with this mindset,
it will affect the kids even more.

01:14:42.428 --> 01:14:43.598
I want a divorce, Radhi.

01:14:43.998 --> 01:14:45.958
As soon as possible.

01:19:31.798 --> 01:19:33.138
Jenifer..
- Mom..

01:19:33.258 --> 01:19:36.828
Ma'am, what happened?
- Ma'am, wake up. - Oh, no..

01:19:36.928 --> 01:19:39.878
Ma'am, are you okay?
- Ma'am, look here. - Get up..

01:19:40.268 --> 01:19:42.688
What happened?
- Ma'am..

01:19:43.038 --> 01:19:43.918
Ma'am.

01:19:45.148 --> 01:19:48.298
Careful, get up.
- I'm okay. - Careful.

01:19:48.608 --> 01:19:50.488
Careful..
- It's okay.

01:19:50.608 --> 01:19:52.718
It's nothing, I'm fine.
- Calm down.

01:19:53.388 --> 01:19:55.418
Are you okay?
- Careful. - I'm fine.

01:19:55.458 --> 01:19:57.258
She's just tired, don't worry.

01:19:57.618 --> 01:19:58.458
It's okay.

01:19:58.738 --> 01:20:00.418
I'm fine, it's nothing.

01:20:01.078 --> 01:20:01.998
Shall we dance?

01:20:03.328 --> 01:20:04.908
She's fine. Relax.

01:20:34.538 --> 01:20:37.708
Ma'am..

01:20:38.618 --> 01:20:39.528
Ma'am.

01:21:07.178 --> 01:21:08.058
Mom..

01:21:11.068 --> 01:21:12.038
Mom..

01:21:14.688 --> 01:21:17.678
Mom, wake up.

01:21:19.118 --> 01:21:21.208
Mom, wake up.

01:21:24.198 --> 01:21:25.128
Mom..

01:21:27.668 --> 01:21:28.578
Wake up..

01:21:32.748 --> 01:21:35.318
I know you are kidding.

01:21:35.838 --> 01:21:38.208
Wake up, Mom.

01:21:41.218 --> 01:21:43.558
I don't have anyone else.
Wake up, Mom.

01:21:44.778 --> 01:21:46.878
Mom, wake up.
Come on.

01:21:47.898 --> 01:21:49.348
Get up, Mom..

01:21:51.268 --> 01:21:52.248
Mom.

01:21:56.188 --> 01:21:57.038
Mom..

01:21:59.658 --> 01:22:00.578
Get up.

01:22:08.838 --> 01:22:09.668
Guna.

01:22:11.828 --> 01:22:14.378
Not everyone is so fortunate, Guna.

01:22:16.098 --> 01:22:17.538
How is this fortunate, ma'am?

01:22:18.888 --> 01:22:20.328
She is too young to die.

01:22:23.798 --> 01:22:26.498
Mom..

01:22:26.598 --> 01:22:30.498
She dedicated her life
and soul to this dance.

01:22:31.288 --> 01:22:33.668
And she danced
in front of her loved ones.

01:22:35.688 --> 01:22:37.708
Dying while doing what you love..

01:22:39.288 --> 01:22:41.498
Not everyone is so fortunate.

01:22:53.788 --> 01:22:54.678
Mom..

01:22:56.158 --> 01:22:57.208
'Get up, Mom.'

01:23:00.628 --> 01:23:02.478
'Don't leave me, Mom.'

